Devin Search (PI-Desktop plugin)
=================================

This plugin is a port of the `pi-devin-search` extension from
https://github.com/mimimaster/dsh-devin-search (MIT License).

Portions of the OAuth (PKCE), web search and read-only local code-search
protocol logic are adapted from that project, which in turn credits
"piwin" (https://github.com/mimimaster/piwin, MIT) for the original
Windsurf/Codeium protocol implementation.

Upstream copyright and MIT license terms are preserved. See the upstream
repository for the full license text and NOTICE.
